                <p class="process-card-description">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Nulla atque sapiente fuga aut cupiditate at, numquam cum animi debitis rerum officia consequuntur.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="process-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart process-card-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <h3 class="process-card-title">Lorem ipsum dolor sit</h3>
                <p class="process-card-description">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Nulla atque sapiente fuga aut cupiditate at, numquam cum animi debitis rerum officia consequuntur.</p>
